          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ng'ura, nelotu Olkushiti; nejo ilo Kushiti, “Ilomon sidain to lkitok lai olaiguanani! Amu kitokordua iyie Olaitoriani ena olong aitung'uaa engolon e pooki apa likitudumakinote iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Olkushiti, “Eisidain mbaa ti alo ilo barnoti Absalom?” Newal ilo Kushiti ajo, “Metaa ilmang'ati lo lkitok lai olaiguanani, o pooki likidumakino aarare iyie te ntorroni, etiu anaa ilo barnoti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyamalu olaiguanani oleng, neilep alo olgilata otii shumata kishomi neishir; naa ore eloito, nejo ninye, “Oi olayioni lai Absalom, olayioni lai, olayioni lai Absalom! Enyor naa katua nanu te rishata ino, Absalom, olayioni lai, olayioni lai!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
